+Source validation and this digest happen before cache lookup. A cache hit therefore cannot bypass inspection of compiler-visible snapshot bytes. The task-scoped Go 1.25.5 Darwin/arm64 smoke produced different artifact hashes (`69f8a5d047b4345d8398750d0d59c0bbd6f60101d5c40689bb31625cc10583fd` and `7ddd293aa1aa441ef83e57a26ad7b886ad9156cac4cde4a317214b870ee5ff23`); conformance requires inequality, not these platform-specific values.
